# Normalise every text file to LF in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# Generated documentation, canonical SHA-256 bindings, and drift checks compare
# byte sequences. Without this, a Windows checkout rewrites text files to CRLF
# and `npm run docs:check` reports false drift that Linux CI never sees.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary case and documentation assets must never be line-ending normalised.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
